c causes, or inflammation.\n\n**Preliminary interpretation**\nThe most supported possibilities at this stage are: **(1)** a systemic cause of fatigue such as anemia, thyroid/metabolic issues, poor sleep, or chronic inflammation, **(2)** fatigue related to blood pressure disease, kidney disease, or their treatment context, and **(3)** a broader issue such as low mood, infection, or another chronic process. What would help most now is narrowing down the pattern of the fatigue and whether there are associated symptoms or functional limits.\n\n**Recommended questions**\nBy answering a few targeted questions, you’ll help me give you a better preliminary interpretation.\n**(1/4)** When did the exhaustion first start, and is it constant all day or worse at certain times?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b220b14ab9b53290169d8f753a5808191a7382124a7ef3247\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":9626,"output":296,"cacheRead":13696,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23618,"cost":{"input":0.024065000000000003,"output":0.00444,"cacheRead":0.003424,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.031929}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775826763369}}
